<title>USA: NYS Dorm Authority repriced, top yield lowered.</title>
<headline>NYS Dorm Authority repriced, top yield lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>said Tuesday it repriced NYS Dormitory Authority's $30 million</p>
<p>bond deal, lowering the yields in 2017 and 2026 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $30,000,000*</p>
<p>SIENA COLLEGE INSURED REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE PRICE CHANGES IN 2006-2009, 2017,2026.</p>
<p>PLEASE LET US KNOW IF YOU ARE GOOD AT THE NEW LEVELS BY 1:00</p>
<p>P.M. EST.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 04/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
